==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Slurpuff|84}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion; both cards have the Draining Kiss attack.
*{{m|Draining Kiss}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Slurpuff}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

